From: richie-rich90454 <rjiang880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0001/0014] Rebrand product.json

Rebrands the application metadata in product.json. Rebased onto upstream
1.137.0: the key set gained sharedDataFolderName, quality, and the darwin
profile UUIDs since this patch was first authored, and those keys are kept.

Target values:
  nameShort/nameLong          Jahaziel Code
  applicationName             jahaziel-code
  dataFolderName              .jahaziel-code
  serverApplicationName       jahaziel-code-server
  serverDataFolderName        .jahaziel-code-server
  urlProtocol                 jahaziel-code
  win32*                      Jahaziel Code / JahazielCode / Jahaziel.Code
  darwinBundleIdentifier      com.example.jahaziel-code
  linuxIconName               jahaziel-code
  licenseUrl/serverLicenseUrl/reportIssueUrl  github.com/example/jahaziel
  quality                     stable

Verification: ide/tests/patch-smoke.sh (0001-*)

---
